  hints:
  - "Two gates block two paths north. The left gate stays open only while someone stands on the stone plate."
  - "Only Dani can pull levers. So Scarlet must stand on the plate to hold the left gate open while Dani crosses to the lever."
  - "Scarlet stands on the plate to open the left gate. Dani goes up the left path and pulls the lever, which opens the right gate. Then Scarlet takes the right path, and both meet at the glowing circle."
